    <ctml:note>chess.com export (56 games; filename says 'rapid' but it carries both sections, distinguished by TimeControl 600+2/180+2). Move clocks authoritative. 16 game(s) have a PGN header final-clock differing from the last %clk: [('rapid', '3', '4', 'White', 0, 602), ('rapid', '4', '2', 'White', 0, 602), ('rapid', '5', '3', 'White', 10, 143), ('rapid', '5', '3', 'Black', 143, 10), ('rapid', '5', '4', 'White', 4, 35), ('rapid', '5', '4', 'Black', 34, 4), ('rapid', '6', '3', 'White', 25, 26), ('rapid', '6', '3', 'Black', 0, 25), ('rapid', '7', '2', 'Black', 0, 5), ('blitz', '8', '4', 'White', 0, 182), ('blitz', '9', '3', 'White', 0, 7), ('blitz', '11', '1', 'White', 0, 3), ('blitz', '12', '3', 'White', 76, 78), ('blitz', '14', '2', 'Black', 2, 5), ('blitz', '14', '4', 'White', 39, 7), ('blitz', '14', '4', 'Black', 7, 39)]. SHA-256 d8f62d442c2e426f9d8eb0ab5472efa6a0f9f38bc3dda697d3c4ac79e5289f19.</ctml:note>
